flowchart LR
  accTitle: A Function appends each journal write to the Workflow run, and when it dies the queue starts another that replays the run
  request[/POST a prompt/] --> fn1[Function A]
  fn1 -->|replay batches| db1[(SQLite in memory)]
  fn1 -->|sql:1, sql:2, ...| world[(Workflow run)]
  fn1 -. dies mid-turn .-> queue[Queue]
  queue --> fn2[Function B]
  world -->|replay| fn2
  fn2 -->|sql:n+1| world
